                            {
                                "example_id": "78a87d11-35df-41dc-a5a0-e0bf5e8f0cb6",
                                "sense_id": "fbd11368-22ad-36b1-af34-937ffca80b11",
                                "text": "Miravich closes his eyes and remembers his days as a slagger. When a mold is full, a slagger moves in with his tool, a technological marvel othereise known as a board slightly larger than a two-by-four. He leans out over the track and skims slag off the top of the boiling steel, risking what is called “catching a flyer,” which occurs when hot metal explodes out of the mold, spraying everyone in the vicinity."
                            }
